# GoodBudget

Before modifying code or docs, read and follow **[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)**.

- Current stack is **Next.js 16.4.6** / React 19 unless `package.json` says otherwise.
- Do not duplicate standards here — AGENTS.md and `docs/` are canonical.
- Preserve auth, UX, and financial data integrity. No unrelated refactors.
- Never use TypeScript `any` or `as any` — use real types or `unknown` + narrowing (`@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any`).
- Never commit or paste secrets from `.env` / `.env.local`.
- After architectural or stack changes, update the relevant files under `docs/`.
